WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.380
Five steps on India's road to

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.260
the Moon.

3
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.990
Counting down.

4
00:00:05.597 --> 00:00:06.897
Number five.

5
00:00:06.897 --> 00:00:09.344
Chandrayaan 1, October 2008.

6
00:00:09.344 --> 00:00:12.317
India's first Moon mission, with

7
00:00:12.317 --> 00:00:14.437
eleven instruments from six

8
00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:15.237
countries.

9
00:00:16.278 --> 00:00:17.598
Number four.

10
00:00:17.598 --> 00:00:20.638
Water. Chandrayaan 1 helped find

11
00:00:20.638 --> 00:00:22.298
water molecules in the lunar

12
00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:25.198
soil. The Moon, it turns out,

13
00:00:25.198 --> 00:00:27.428
was not as dry as advertised.

14
00:00:28.213 --> 00:00:29.433
Number three.

15
00:00:29.433 --> 00:00:32.053
Chandrayaan 2, July 2019.

16
00:00:32.053 --> 00:00:35.273
An orbiter, a lander and a

17
00:00:35.273 --> 00:00:36.593
rover, launched from

18
00:00:36.593 --> 00:00:37.443
Sriharikota.

19
00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:39.801
Number two.

20
00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:41.451
September 2019:

21
00:00:41.451 --> 00:00:44.481
the lander, Vikram, was lost

22
00:00:44.481 --> 00:00:45.661
during its descent.

23
00:00:45.661 --> 00:00:48.381
The orbiter kept working, and

24
00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.691
still does.

25
00:00:50.504 --> 00:00:52.044
Number one.

26
00:00:52.044 --> 00:00:53.424
Chandrayaan 3.

27
00:00:53.424 --> 00:00:55.484
On the twenty third of August,

28
00:00:55.484 --> 00:00:58.044
2023, Vikram soft landed near

29
00:00:58.044 --> 00:00:59.784
the Moon's south pole.

30
00:00:59.784 --> 00:01:02.024
India became the fourth country

31
00:01:02.024 --> 00:01:03.204
to land on the Moon.

32
00:01:03.204 --> 00:01:05.364
The rover followed, and found

33
00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:06.174
sulphur.

34
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:08.635
For GS3:

35
00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:11.693
Chandrayaan one, two and three.

36
00:01:11.693 --> 00:01:14.382
2008, 2019, 2023.

37
00:01:14.382 --> 00:01:17.455
A soft landing near the south

38
00:01:17.455 --> 00:01:18.255
pole.

39
00:01:18.976 --> 00:01:20.176
Five steps.

40
00:01:20.176 --> 00:01:21.646
One Moon.
